#: .\shop\templates\shop\homepage.html:4 .\shop\templates\shop\homepage.html:8
#: .\shop\templates\shop\illustration_gallery.html:4
msgid "Welcome to HEARTH Shop"
msgstr "Bienvenido a HEARTH Shop"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\homepage.html:10
msgid ""
"A nature, family, and kid-friendly selection of illustrations and "
"photographs made to bring calm and warmth into everyday spaces. Feel free to "
"browse through the collections at your own pace."
msgstr ""
"Una selección de ilustraciones y fotografías cercana a la naturaleza, "
"familiar y apta para niños, pensada para aportar calma y calidez a los "
"espacios cotidianos. Explora las colecciones a tu ritmo."

#: .\shop\templates\shop\homepage.html:20
msgid "Discover Our Art — read the story behind HEARTH"
msgstr "Descubre nuestro arte — lee la historia detrás de HEARTH"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\homepage.html:21
msgid "Discover Our Art"
msgstr "Descubre nuestro arte"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\homepage.html:32
msgid "A place for art between the earth and the heart."
msgstr "Un lugar para el arte entre la tierra y el corazón."

#: .\shop\templates\shop\homepage.html:35
msgid ""
"While a hearth already carries its own quiet meaning, HEARTH is also a "
"gentle wordplay on two values behind our work: heart and earth."
msgstr ""
"Aunque «hearth» ya tiene su propio significado sereno, HEARTH es también un "
"sutil juego de palabras con dos valores de nuestro trabajo: corazón (heart) "
"y tierra (earth)."

#: .\shop\templates\shop\homepage.html:39
msgid ""
"“Whoever wants to know something about me—as an artist, which alone is "
"significant—should look attentively at my pictures and there seek to "
"recognize what I am and what I want.”"
msgstr ""
"«Quien quiera saber algo de mí —como artista, que es lo único que importa—, "
"debe mirar atentamente mis cuadros y buscar allí reconocer lo que soy y lo "
"que quiero.»"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\homepage.html:41
msgid "Gustav Klimt"
msgstr "Gustav Klimt"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\illustration_gallery.html:10
msgid ""
"Laser-engraved original graphics hand-coloured with acrylic colours in A4 "
"format. If you would like other sizes or formats, please reach out through "
"the contact form in the navigation bar."
msgstr ""
"Gráficos originales grabados con láser y coloreados a mano con acrílicos en "
"formato A4. Si deseas otros tamaños o formatos, escríbenos a través del "
"formulario de contacto en la barra de navegación."

